chapter.v:
Then the 


Levites arose,, 


Mahath the son of Amasai, and Joel the son of Azariah, of the sons of the Kohathites; and of the sons of Merari, Kish the son of Abdi, and Azariah the son of Jehallelel; and of the Gershonites, Joah the son of Zimmah, and Eden the son of Joah;

and of 


the sons, 


of Elizaphan, Shimri and Jeuel; and of the sons of Asaph, Zechariah and Mattaniah;
